\subtree{
  \title{Decision}
  \p{Begin with searchable Markdown/registry records and exact declaration lookup. After \ref{ms-foundation}, the optional read-only MCP provides search, get, dependency neighbors, open tasks, decisions, acceptances, and type search over the built environment. Index active nodes by default; historical nodes require an explicit history filter. Hybrid embedding search is an enhancement, not an \ref{ms-0000} mathematical prerequisite.}
}
\subtree{
  \title{Rationale}
  \p{Retrieval should expose validated work and unresolved dependencies accurately.}
}
\subtree{
  \title{Rejected}
  \p{Building a large search stack before there is a meaningful proof corpus.}
}
\subtree{
  \title{Acceptance}
  \p{Current-versus-historical retrieval examples and dependency-order tasks.}
}
\subtree{
  \title{Status}
  \p{provisional, expand at \ref{ms-0001}/\ref{ms-0003} as useful.}
}
